{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 164153, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 108737, "uid": 176744, "type": 4, "title": "WB入门", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1659739965, "updated_at": 1662165972, "updated_uid": 176744, "comment_at": 1662165883, "last_at": 1668596174, "comment_count": 2, "status": 1, "summary": "嗨嗨嗨，虽然不是同一个boss，但是同一个场所。今天就让我老四来教教萌新wb是什么和在wb应该干什么。WB简介显而易见，WB（worldboss）就是全服的人一起打一只血量巨厚的世界boss，每打死一", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_578/h_909/1164/176744/2022/7/6/645855.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_559/h_505/1164/176744/2022/7/6/166857.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_655/h_1326/1164/176744/2022/7/6/123303.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 5, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 5202, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 164153, "content": "<div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"797\" data-height=\"379\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_797/h_379/1164/176744/2022/7/6/883463.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_797/h_379/1164/176744/2022/7/6/883463.png\" style=\"height: 294.688px; width: 698.984px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 嗨嗨嗨，虽然不是同一个boss，但是同一个场所。今天就让我老四来教教萌新wb是什么和在wb应该干什么。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">WB简介</span></div></div><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 显而易见，WB（world boss）就是全服的人一起打一只血量巨厚的世界boss，每打死一只就会刷新一只。<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">boss不会变强</span>，第一只boss和第300只boss的属性什么的完全一样。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><img data-width=\"578\" data-height=\"909\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_578/h_909/1164/176744/2022/7/6/645855.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_578/h_909/1164/176744/2022/7/6/645855.png\"></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">wb基础</span></div></div><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"> WB只能自动，不能手动，为了伤害最大化往往选择一倍速打wb，二倍速可考虑，但一般不会选择三倍速打。会被吞掉很多伤害。&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">1、wb每打一次需要消耗一张票。票的获取方式有两种。</span><br></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\">1.<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">每2个小时刷新一张</span>。每一只世界boss最多可自动重复三次。（打一次后有个再来一次的选项）</div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">2.<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">买票</span>，一天最多可买40次，买一次直接塞满6张票。</div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">想测试伤害或者试探阵容可以点练习模式，这个模式不会消耗票数但同样也不会获得奖励。</div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"559\" data-height=\"505\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_559/h_505/1164/176744/2022/7/6/166857.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_559/h_505/1164/176744/2022/7/6/166857.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">2<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:24px;text-align:left;\">、队伍要求</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">20名天子</span>，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">前排优先满级防具和饰品和防血的魂卡，后排优先满级武器和饰品和对应输出魂卡。</span></span></span></span></span>一般而言最低要求就是<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">前排衣服穿好，后排武器拿好</span>就行了。装备和魂卡不足的萌新可以参考一下。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">3<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:24px;text-align:left;\">、ds设置</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">虽然wb模式里你最多可以设置10个ds的释放顺序。<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">但往往我们都是以3次ds进ft</span>为一个循环只设置3个ds。系统会自动按照你设置的顺序循环释放。（不过现在很多ds的效果都能持续3回合了，或许以后大家会以6个ds两轮ft为一循环来设置也说不定）</span></span></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">WB奖励</span></div></div></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">首先是每次挑战的奖励&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;</span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"> wb的每一次挑战奖励与伤害，存活时间都无关，只与你的加成天子有关。</span>也就是说你这次打了1e也好，打了2w也罢，只要加成天子给的加成是一样的，你都只会获得1100乘以你的加成的硬币奖励。</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">然后是每天奖励</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">与你这一天内的总伤害排名有关。而且因为是抽卡模式，所以大佬6张卡翻出来的奖励说不定还不如你2张五星卷来的香。硬币数量也和排名息息相关，可能这就是大佬的保底吧，至少人家能换完商店。</span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">当天排名奖励</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"655\" data-height=\"1326\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_655/h_1326/1164/176744/2022/7/6/123303.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_655/h_1326/1164/176744/2022/7/6/123303.png\"></div></div>\n                               </div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">每赛季奖励</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;与你总伤害排名有关，差一点点进入下一个奖励阶段可以考虑买买票</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">赛季奖励（例）</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"527\" data-height=\"892\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_527/h_892/1164/176744/2022/7/6/229043.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_527/h_892/1164/176744/2022/7/6/229043.png\"></div></div>\n                               </div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">最后是击杀奖励，除了特别次数的奖励是固定的其他的都是随机抽取，看运气哦。</span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><img data-width=\"1283\" data-height=\"794\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1283/h_794/1164/176744/2022/7/6/645511.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1283/h_794/1164/176744/2022/7/6/645511.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">所以说出啥奖励全靠运气，唯一需要注意的就是250车以后每50车给点火材料。</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\"></span></div></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">萌新常见问题</span></div></div><br></div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">我站不住怎么办？</span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">答，前排塞满满练度的天子和装备魂卡。后排可以剩下来衣服给前排穿。其次不要盲目抄，站不住就多上奶，活命吗，不寒掺。</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">我要买票吗？</span><br>一般伤害低于1亿的萌新都不是很建议买票，但是你要是这次加成拉满的话可以考虑买买票换奖励。</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">商店我要买什么？</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">点火石优先，然后就是从划算的五星卷开始买。</span></span></div></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">为什么WB小毕业是5000万？</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">因为每次WB开放都会有个wb伤害挑战奖励，最高一档是5000万的装备附魔石奖励。</div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">wb伤害挑战奖励</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center; \"><img data-width=\"531\" data-height=\"809\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_531/h_809/1164/176744/2022/7/6/199221.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_531/h_809/1164/176744/2022/7/6/199221.png\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br><br></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></div></span><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><br></span></div></div><br></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_578/h_909/1164/176744/2022/7/6/645855.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_559/h_505/1164/176744/2022/7/6/166857.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_655/h_1326/1164/176744/2022/7/6/123303.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 176744, "username": "咸鱼老四", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/22.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 1, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 123153171, "content_num": 45, "read_num": 135566, "like_num": 59}, "update_user": {"uid": 176744, "username": "咸鱼老四", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/22.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 1, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1164, "name": "天命之子日服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/57/2022/0/26/583959.png", "alias": "dcj", "content_count": 1066, "follow_count": 708}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": ""